    "biography": "<table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Halloway&#39;s childe (only if nobody plays Celeste Arden)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Looks thirty-something, corporate lawyer Embraced in 2009. He fills Celeste&#39;s role (@UUID[JournalEntry.zQMt8VMfKPoL6INq]{Celeste Arden}): he signs for the Cascade Holdings accounts and is the Council&#39;s scapegoat. He knows less than he thinks.</p>\n<p><strong>If he&#39;s accused at the Council:</strong> he falls apart. A <a class=\"sbn-tirada\" data-sbn-tirada=\"attributes.charisma skills.persuasion\" data-dificultad=\"2\" data-label=\"Charisma + Persuasion (Difficulty 2)\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-dice-d10\"></i> Charisma + Persuasion (Difficulty 2)</a> roll convinces him to testify against Halloway (+2 dice to the case).</p>",
